l\">\n            <img className=\"rounded-[calc(20px-12px)] rounded-b-none\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559056199-641a0ac8b55e?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w0NzEyNjZ8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHw3fHxwcm9kdWN0fGVufDB8MHx8fDE3MTIwNjI5MDF8MA&ixlib=rb-4.0.3&q=80&w=1080\" alt=\"Innovative UI Design Solutions\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 250px;\" />\n            <div className=\"flex flex-col gap-y-2\">\n              <h4 className=\"text-2xl font-bold text-black dark lg\">Innovative UI Design Solutions</h4>\n              <p className=\"text-black dark text-sm lg\">Transform your ideas into reality with our\n                cutting-edge UI design solutions that captivate your audience.</p>\n              <button className=\"flex item-start bg-black text-white w-fit px-5 py-1 rounded-full\">Get Started</button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n",
